t;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;2. None&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;3. The Company does not have any employees. All of the company management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Harvest Midstream.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;4. Arrowhead Eagle Ford Pipeline, LLC (the Company), a Texas limited liability company, was formed on April 20,2011, and is engaged in the business of transporting crude oil in Texas.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Arrowhead ST Holdings, LLC (ASTH) owns 100%-member interest in the Company. Harvest Midstream I, L.P. (HMI) owns a 100%-member interest in ASTH.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Harvest Midstream Company (HMC) acts as the operator for HMI and for the assets owned by the Company. On January 31, 25 the company purchased Helena Pipeline, Whitsett Pipeline and Whitsett Terminal.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;5. The Company does not pay federal or state income taxes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;6. None&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
